 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/Makefile             |   1 +
 .../dts/qcom/mahua-hp-omnibook-5-bf1xxx.dts   |  36 -----
 .../dts/qcom/mahua-hp-omnibook-5-bf1xxx.dtsi  | 130 ------------------
 3 files changed, 1 insertion(+), 166 deletions(-)

